    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Helping people realize their potential — and live for more.</h1>
    <p>This blog rests on one belief: most people are capable of far more than they've been shown, and the right idea at the right moment can change the direction of a life.</p>
    <p>The essays here are about realizing your potential, building a habit of continuous learning, staying humble enough to keep growing, and choosing a fuller, more fulfilling life on purpose rather than by default.</p>
    <p>It isn't about status or hustle for its own sake. It's about making sure that wherever you end up, you got there by choice.</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="profile">
    <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">{{ site.initials }}</div>
    <h2>{{ site.author }}</h2>
    <p class="role">Writer · Lifelong learner</p>
    <p>The name comes from <em>Remilekun Ìmọ́lẹ̀</em>: one who brings comfort, and the light.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0">That is the hope for every essay here: to meet you where you are, and then help you see a little further.</p>
  </aside>
